🔑 Key Differentiators vs n8n
To stand out, focus on these unique capabilities:

Feature	n8n	Your Platform (Goal)
AI-Native	❌ Bolt-on	✅ Built for agents
Autonomous Mode	❌ No	✅ Deep Mode (5+ hours)
Vision AI	❌ No	✅ Screenshot analysis
Code Generation	❌ No	✅ Devin-style coding
Human Approvals	⚠️ Basic	✅ Rich context + mobile
Cost Tracking	❌ No	✅ Per-workflow analytics
Safety Guardrails	❌ No	✅ Budget, PII, toxicity
